<title>USA: Home Products International to sell shares.</title>
<headline>Home Products International to sell shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Products International Inc on Tuesday said it filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to offer 3.5 million common shares.</p>
<p>Two million will be sold by the consumer housewares company and 1.5 million by the estate and trusts of a former chief executive officer of the company.</p>
<p>EVEREN Securities is underwriting the offering.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
